  "description": "A rabbit, who was going to be sold by a human trafficking group to a wealthy pervert, escapes into the forest when the group's cart gets attacked by an unknown monster. After wandering around the forest for some time, the rabbit arrives at an abandoned-looking house and, unable to overcome his hunger, he eats a flower... But it turns out that the flower is precious to the owner of the house, Willow! Willow tells the rabbit to 'pay with his body', but...",
